":"comment","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/800#issuecomment-930682","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/800","user":{"id":73579,"login":"earl-warren","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"Earl Warren","email":"earl-warren@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/baa02ddebf727ef06a0ded0aee5a25cc","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/earl-warren","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2022-11-26T18:56:24+01:00","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","pronouns":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":50,"following_count":2,"starred_repos_count":28,"username":"earl-warren"},"body":"\u003e Which scripts will get broken if this is fixed?\r\n\r\nThat's the thing... there is no way to know. This bug is an inconsistency and there may exist scripts that assume this behavior (lowercase conversion). Switching to preserving case would be a breaking change for such scripts.","created_at":"2023-06-05T19:03:15+02:00","updated_at":"2023-06-05T19:03:15+02:00","old_project_id":0,"project_id":0,"old_milestone":null,"milestone":null,"tracked_time":null,"old_title":"","new_title":"","old_ref":"","new_ref":"","ref_issue":null,"ref_comment":null,"ref_action":"none","ref_commit_sha":"","review_id":0,"label":null,"assignee":null,"assignee_team":null,"removed_assignee":false,"resolve_doer":null,"dependent_issue":null},{"id":930801,"type":"comment","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/800#issuecomment-930801","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/800","user":{"id":99957,"login":"greenpete","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"Peter Green","email":"greenpete@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/b5ea065dbae67175d66cb530a284afc114eff5fcd25f4189d8fe3ada8d548e04","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/greenpete","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2023-06-03T21:14:25+02:00","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"U.K.","pronouns":"","website":"https://greenpete.co.uk/","description":"Trying to learn to code the hard way - slowly teaching myself.\r\nMainly Bash at the moment, but hopefully some Python and Nim later.","visibility":"public","followers_count":1,"following_count":0,"starred_repos_count":0,"username":"greenpete"},"body":"I'd like to emphasize that there are four elements at play here that have discrepancies...\n\n1. The title of the repo' as entered by you when you create the repo' in Forgejo.\n2. The archive that is available to download in .zip or .tar.gz\n3. The name of the unpacked archive.\n4. The root directory on your local machine that is pulled from a Forgejo instance.\n\nAll but the first are generated by Forgejo and one of them doesn't match the title you give to the repo'.\n\nThis discrepancy alone I think is cause for concern.","created_at":"2023-06-05T21:07:37+02:00","updated_at":"2023-06-05T21:22:36+02:00","old_project_id":0,"project_id":0,"old_milestone":null,"milestone":null,"tracked_time":null,"old_title":"","new_title":"","old_ref":"","new_ref":"","ref_issue":null,"ref_comment":null,"ref_action":"none","ref_commit_sha":"","review_id":0,"label":null,"assignee":null,"assignee_team":null,"removed_assignee":false,"resolve_doer":null,"dependent_issue":null},{"id":930810,"type":"comment","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/800#issuecomment-930810","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/800","user":{"id":73579,"login":"earl-warren","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"Earl Warren","email":"earl-warren@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/baa02ddebf727ef06a0ded0aee5a25cc","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/earl-warren","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"20