ebsite":"https://gusted.xyz","description":"I’m aware (and the NSA is), that I’m pretty 🌈.\r\n\r\nForgejo contributor  \r\nCodeberg executive board member 2025-2026  \r\nCodeberg presidium member 2025-2027  \r\n\r\nFor more interesting repositories: https://git.gusted.xyz/Gusted","visibility":"public","followers_count":163,"following_count":30,"starred_repos_count":104,"username":"Gusted"},"body":"","created_at":"2024-11-27T01:43:40+01:00","updated_at":"2024-11-27T01:43:40+01:00","old_project_id":0,"project_id":0,"old_milestone":null,"milestone":null,"tracked_time":null,"old_title":"","new_title":"","old_ref":"","new_ref":"","ref_issue":{"id":897360,"url":"https://codeberg.org/api/v1/repos/Codeberg/Community/issues/1671","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/Codeberg/Community/issues/1671","number":1671,"user":{"id":113342,"login":"RainerBielefeld","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"rainerbielefeld@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/0d06d40035cf07a2368257b4b1a88bb41b3129675d5a90c38d47821dcfad5463","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/RainerBielefeld","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2023-08-18T18:11:47+02:00","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"","pronouns":"","website":"","description":"","visibility":"public","followers_count":1,"following_count":1,"starred_repos_count":1,"username":"RainerBielefeld"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"title":"Zips from Codeberg do not respect case sensitivity of folder names","body":"## I checked 2 Plugin .zip and .tar \nfor Plugins _[Calendar](https://codeberg.org/abu/Calendar/)_  and _[SubtaskDescription](https://codeberg.org/abu/SubtaskDescription)_  Here I will tell my experience with _Calendar_; was all the same for SubtaskDescription\n\n1. download .zip or .tar from [Repository](https://codeberg.org/abu/Calendar/)   using ˋWeitere Optionen → ZIP herunterladenˊ\n2. Unzip   \n   » Result contains folder _calendar_ \n3. Compare folder names with your KANBOARD installation in Folder _plugins_, \n   » **Surprise**: The folder name in Installation is  _**C**alendar_     \nThat means that the Plugin folder names in the download.zip do not respect  case sensitivity of Plugin Folder names 😥\n\n## I did some additional research  \na) For Comparison I downloaded the linked .zip which I reach from KANBOARD installation's Plugin Controller. \nI did my test with Calendar Plugin. The Hyperlink behind \"Install\" is  \n\n```\nhttp://\u003cMyInstallation\u003e/?controller=PluginController\u0026action=install\u0026archive_url=https%253A%252F%252Fcodeberg.org%252Fapi%252Fpackages%252Fabu%252Fgeneric%252FCalendar%252F1.5.0%252FCalendar-1.5.0.zip\u0026csrf_token=5397e25423aceb67e2fb2c39c4f12afa14f317e8351fcf275b3c9390127ffb01\n```\nI extracted the link to the file in Repository:  \n\n```\nhttps://codeberg.org/api/packages/abu/generic/calendar/1.5.0/calendar-1.5.0.zip/\n```\n  \nClick on [that link](https://codeberg.org/api/packages/abu/generic/calendar/1.5.0/calendar-1.5.0.zip/)  starts download of a file _Calendar-1.5.0.zip_  \nI unzipped that file and found the correct Plugin folder file name _**C**alendar_  👍  \n\nb) And now I see the hint on the Repository page:  \n![](https://imgur.com/21e8fNz.png!)   \nGood Grief! How can someone who downloaded the plugin know the Case of the folder names? If the installation .zip does it right it should not be too difficult to do that right also for the download .zip    \n\nc) I also tried a KANBOARD plugin on github: [MarkdownPlus](https://github.com/creecros/MarkdownPlus/releases): \n1. Visit [Releases Repository](https://github.com/creecros/MarkdownPlus/releases)\n2.  download _[MarkdownPlus-1.1.5.zip](https://github.com/creecros/MarkdownPlus/releases/download/1.1.5/MarkdownPlus-1.1.5.zip)_\n3. Unzip (to \"MarkdownPlus-1.1.5\"!)  \n4. Check folders below  \"MarkdownPlus-1.1.5\"\n   » Contains Plugin Folder with correct name MarkdownPlus – respecting Case Sensivity.  \n  \n## **Looks like a Codeberg Bug.**  \n _[Libelle/Libelle](https://codeberg.org/Libelle/Libelle)_ might also suffer from that problem / bug.\n","ref":"","assets":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":null,"state":"open","is_locked":false,"comments":6,"created_at":"2024-10-13T17:26:39+02:00","updated_at":"2025-05-03T17:10:07+02:00","closed_at":null,"due_date":null,"pull_request":null,"repository":{"id":1,"name":"Community","owner":"Codeberg","full_name":"Codeberg/Community"},"pin_order":0},"ref_comment":{"id":2475478,"html_url":"https://codeberg.org/Codeberg/Community/issues/1671#issuecomment-2475478","pull_request_url":"","issue_url":"https://codeberg.org/Codeberg/Community/issues/1671","user":{"id":26734,"login":"Gusted","login_name":"","source_id":0,"full_name":"","email":"gusted@noreply.codeberg.org","avatar_url":"https://codeberg.org/avatars/44a59264e976fa585ed9f0a92abad9d7","html_url":"https://codeberg.org/Gusted","language":"","is_admin":false,"last_login":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","created":"2021-04-12T21:28:08+02:00","restricted":false,"active":false,"prohibit_login":false,"location":"Error 451","pronouns":"","website":"https://gusted.xyz","description":"I’m aware (and the NSA is), that I’m pretty 🌈.\r\n\r\nForgejo contributor  \r\nCodeberg executive board member 2025-2026  \r\nCodeberg presidium member 2025-2027  \r\n\r\nFor more interesting repositories: https://git.gusted.xyz/Gusted","visibility":"public","followers_count":163,"following_count":30,"starred_repos_count":104,"username":"Gusted"},"original_author":"","original_author_id":0,"body":"Related issue over at forgejo/forgejo#800","assets":[],"created_at":"2024-11-27T01:43:40+01:00","updated_at":"2024-11-27T01:43:40+01:00"},"ref_action":"none","ref_commit_sha":"","review_id":0,"label":null,"assignee":null,"assignee_team":null,"removed_assignee":false,"resolve_doer":null,"dependent_issue":null},{"id":4087886,"type":"comment","html_url":"https://co